    **Example**

    ```hot
    ::guilds ::discord::guilds

    roles ::guilds/modify-guild-role-positions(::guilds/ModifyGuildRolePositionsRequest({
      guild_id: "1000000000000000000",
      positions: [{id: "1900000000000000000", position: 3}],
      reason: "Above the bot roles"
    }))
    map(roles, %.name)
    ```
    """
}
